see how animators,

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like,
capture your essence.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you are a very coveted
voice actor.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
