00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-You know?

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:32.859 line:92%
And I love that in "Big Mouth,

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:34.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
