00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:47.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
Listen, Seth,
I'm not going to lie to you.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:51.277
I haven't left my God damn house
in a year.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:54.180 line:92%
I have lost my mind, okay?

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:57.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I'm going for a full circl
of hair and beard.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.486 line:92%
That's what I'm aiming for

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:02.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
