with a beard like that.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.829 line:92%
-Oh, such a great question

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:12.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I did, like,
honestly, have to,

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:15.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, think about that,
and I made a purchase of a mas

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:17.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
that specifically
