00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
also a little bit
of how I feel on the inside.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:28.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hold on. I'll just -- I'm goin
to grab it and put it on.

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:30.416 line:92%
It's been great for, like,

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:36.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
