00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:12.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes.
-Okay.

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:13.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These are paintings.
These are --

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:16.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like I said, I've been hom
alone for a year.

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:18.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
so, like, these are the people
